         ---------------------------------------------------------

                        C N E T - T O P  M E S S Y

                 Version 1.1 by Raff Nixx / United Forces

         ---------------------------------------------------------


        This is a C-File for the C-Net BBS System which provides a
                         TOP MESSAGE WRITER LIST.


You may call this one in the log-in procedure or whereever you want.
TopMessy displays a 2-column top messagewriters list with the top-10
public- (on the left) AND the top-10 private-messagewriters (on the right).

Version 1.1 has the great ability to configure the complete outfit of
the chart. There is a Header, Format and Footer file
("S:UFO/TopMessy.Header","S:UFO/TopMessy.Formats" and
"S:UFO/TopMessy.Footer") where you may draw your own header, footer and
chart outfit!

Take a look at the example files to see how it works. It should not be
that difficult for you to change it. I did put them into a seperate
subdirectory within your S: directory, coz' everyone is putting it's
configuration files here, so it's just for keeping some order.


I hate typing docs...

 Bye, Raff Nixx / United Forces.
